            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.9.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 9:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.43+MRK.10.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:43–44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariye mkpwulu kuriko mosi mwenu kundini ni lazima akale mtumishi wa anjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adzikpwezaye andatserezwa, na adzitserezaye andakpwezwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shaka hiro mwi alimu a Shariya na Mafarisayo, anafiki mwi! Mnafungira ayawenu miryango ya mlunguni, mana mwimwi enye tamuinjira, wala tamuaruhusu ayawenu alondao kuinjira, ainjire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shaka hiro mwi alimu a Shariya na Mafarisayo, anafiki mwi! Mkufuta vitu vya magungu na kudzihenda kukala mu atu anono kpwa kuvoya mavoyo mare. Kpwa hivyo mundaphaha adabu kali sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vya kare tavina msitari wa 14.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shaka rani ro, mwi alimu a Shariya na Mafarisayo, anafiki mwi! Mkuhenda vyaro vya baharini na tsi za kure ili mphahe mutu mmwenga alunge dini yenu. Ela mchimphaha, mukumuhenda akale mui zaidi na kuinjirakpwe mohoni kukale kano mbiri ya mwimwi enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shaka rani ro, mwi vilongozi vipofu! Mnadzichenga kukala mutu achiapa kuhadza Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu hata asiphotimiza chilaganeche nkukala kana neno. Ela achiapa kuhadza zahabu iriyo ndani ya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu, ni asivundze chilagane arichochiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vipofu apumbavu mwi! Ni chiphi cha mana zaidi: zahabu hebu Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu ihendayo iyo zahabu kukala takatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya mkugomba mukaamba, mutu yeyesi ndiyeapa kuhadza phatu pha kulavira sadaka si chitu; ela achiapa kuhadza sadaka ichiyoikpwa dzuluye, ni asivundze cho chilaganeche arichochiika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwi vipofu! Ni chiphi cha mana zaidi: hira sadaka, au phatu pha kulavira sadaka ambapho nkuhenda hira sadaka kukala takatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi yeyesi aapaye kuhadza phatu pha kulavira sadaka nkuapa kpwa hipho phatu pha kulavira sadaka, na chochosi chirichoikpwa dzuluze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aapaye kuhadza Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu nkuapa kpwa iyo nyumba na Mlungu asagalaye himo ndani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 66:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aapaye kuhadza mlunguni nkuapa kuhadza chihi cha endzi cha Mlungu na iye achisagariraye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
